{"w":2400,"h":3209,"lines":[{"t":"Introduction","y":0.03924418594968504,"w":0.11844660441080712,"x":0.78446601806107019,"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1},{"h":0.017527892804962808,"y":0.085669781720397076,"c":1,"w":0.63689320882161449,"t":"HOW SHOULD YOU INTERPRET YOUR SCORES?","x":0.067961162462134864},{"c":1,"h":0.015988371899566145,"x":0.066019419106013971,"y":0.12645348846682802,"w":0.79417475382486979,"t":"At the end of each Listening and Reading answer key you will find a chart which will help"},{"c":1,"w":0.78252426147460941,"t":"you assess whether, on the basis of your practice test results, you are ready to take the","h":0.017579511838538564,"y":0.14534883709265689,"x":0.06601942248762574},{"h":0.015266590772016753,"t":"IELTS test.","x":0.06398893426489155,"y":0.16387833250572892,"w":0.10503184000651042,"c":1},{"x":0.085436893843671549,"w":0.76893203735351556,"t":"In interpreting your score, there are a number of points you should bear in mind. Your","y":0.18313953497834023,"h":0.015988371899566145,"c":1},{"x":0.066019406018938104,"t":"performance in the real IELTS test will be reported in two ways: there will be a Band Score","y":0.20203488342884712,"h":0.014534884301301454,"c":1,"w":0.80970876057942709},{"h":0.023664998562536566,"c":1,"x":0.06587069065907504,"y":0.21526576871324399,"w":0.78477198282877603,"t":"from 1 to 9 for each of the components and an Overall Band Score from 1 to 9, which is"},{"t":"the average of your scores in the four components. However, institutions considering your","w":0.80776697794596364,"y":0.2383177572414894,"h":0.017496196354661042,"x":0.06407767598741268,"c":1},{"w":0.77096089680989588,"t":"application are advised to look at both the Overall Band Score and the Band Score for","h":0.017507005257769936,"y":0.25581398397039457,"c":1,"x":0.065973390022466744},{"h":0.016199376947040434,"c":1,"x":0.066019417378898312,"t":"each component in order to determine whether you have the language skills needed for a","w":0.80000000000000004,"y":0.27601246082215736},{"t":"particular course of study. For example, if your course involves a lot of reading and writing,","h":0.019042055480576803,"x":0.06601943843094224,"y":0.29345794400686409,"w":0.81165044148763021,"c":1},{"t":"but no lectures, listening skills might be less important and a score of 5 in Listening might be","y":0.31395348825945979,"w":0.82718444824218751,"x":0.066019426265862075,"h":0.017510686262374286,"c":1},{"t":"acceptable if the Overall Band Score was 7. However, for a course which has lots of lectures","x":0.066019408638012561,"y":0.3313953487211776,"w":0.82912623087565096,"h":0.017514308442207804,"c":1},{"h":0.017576795203663509,"w":0.80000000000000004,"c":1,"y":0.35015576304216423,"x":0.06601941733459625,"t":"and spoken instructions, a score of 5 in Listening might be unacceptable even though the"},{"c":1,"y":0.36915887847031836,"t":"Overall Band Score was 7.","w":0.24466018676757811,"h":0.016015540030886455,"x":0.066019421079782745},{"x":0.08932038380563663,"y":0.38808139523606,"w":0.78640777587890609,"h":0.017526081120856407,"c":1,"t":"Once you have marked your tests, you should have some idea of whether your listening"},{"y":0.40685358282865969,"t":"and reading skills are good enough for you to try the IELTS test. If you did well enough in","w":0.79611648559570325,"h":0.017565021930825209,"c":1,"x":0.066019427009955028},{"x":0.066019426256378702,"w":0.82718444824218751,"h":0.01745725554469213,"c":1,"y":0.42585669805060822,"t":"one component, but not in others, you will have to decide for yourself whether you are ready"},{"w":0.14368932088216146,"h":0.014649894452911982,"x":0.06601941712763254,"c":1,"t":"to take the test.","y":0.44610591918633657},{"y":0.46355140163216491,"h":0.016199376947040545,"t":"The practice tests have been checked to ensure that they are the same level of difficulty","w":0.790291239420573,"x":0.08737865203197695,"c":1},{"x":0.065971390251232456,"y":0.48084991057675919,"w":0.80592356363932294,"c":1,"h":0.018820097141919456,"t":"as the real IELTS test. However, we cannot guarantee that your score in the practice tests"},{"w":0.80970876057942698,"y":0.49999999988696853,"x":0.066019406025944916,"t":"will be reflected in the real IELTS test. The practice tests can only give you an idea of your","h":0.017445482866043638,"c":1},{"x":0.066019427736164094,"c":1,"t":"possible future performance and it is ultimately up to you to make decisions based on","y":0.51889534872384924,"w":0.76504852294921877,"h":0.017553249252176717},{"c":1,"w":0.104854367574056,"t":"your score.","x":0.066019418049865192,"y":0.54069767432261318,"h":0.013196406854647291},{"t":"Different institutions accept different IELTS scores for different types of courses. We have","x":0.089260730546438363,"y":0.55504461949939021,"w":0.79816797892252611,"h":0.018861888279424588,"c":1},{"w":0.82718444824218762,"c":1,"x":0.066019432189585725,"y":0.57412790724236362,"t":"based our recommendations on the average scores which the majority of institutions accept.","h":0.017460877724525758},{"x":0.066019408734352206,"t":"The institution to which you are applying may, of course, require a higher or lower score than","y":0.59439252363874673,"w":0.82912623087565107,"h":0.017526081120856407,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.015885164730274126,"y":0.61210989288316164,"t":"most other institutions.","w":0.20615538279215495,"x":0.065881887084335636},{"y":0.95348837225167837,"x":0.88349514593893275,"c":1,"t":"9","w":0.015533979733785008,"h":0.01453488311292217}]}